{"Full: frame rate and frame times, CPU, GPU, memory, temperatures and power. Compact: one line - FPS, FPS+FG (with frame generation's in-between frames: about twice FPS while it generates), the app's RAM and the battery temperature.",
 "Completo: taxa e tempos de quadro, CPU, GPU, memória, temperaturas e consumo. Resumido: uma linha - FPS, FPS+FG (com os quadros intermediários da geração de quadros: cerca do dobro do FPS enquanto ela gera), a RAM do app e a temperatura da bateria."},
{"Mods replace the game's files: each is a folder with a romfs folder inside, as for Eden or Ryujinx. Turning one on or off applies when the game starts again: Quit -> Return to start, then Play. A translation replaces one of the game's languages - usually US English: keep Language (Controls page) on Auto or English.",
